    "body": "## Context\n\nPR #67 adds the age review clock — 15-day case management for under-16 reports. When a flagged user submits their parent's email via the mobile app, the email is saved to the case and the clock pauses. Currently, the moderator sees the email in the admin UI and handles outreach manually.\n\nThis issue adds Zendesk automation so parent contact is tracked as a ticket with proper threading, SLA, and reply detection.\n\n## Scope\n\n### Outbound: auto-create Zendesk ticket on parent email submission\n\nWhen `POST /v1/minor-review-cases/{caseId}/parent-contact` saves the parent email:\n\n- Create a Zendesk ticket addressed to the parent email\n- Template body explains the situation, asks parent to reply to verify\n- Tag the ticket `age-review` + include case ID in a custom field or internal note\n- Use existing Zendesk API patterns from `worker/src/index.ts` (ticket creation, custom fields)\n- Non-blocking: ticket creation failure should not fail the parent-contact endpoint (log + continue)\n\n### Inbound: webhook on parent reply\n\n- New endpoint: `POST /api/zendesk/age-review-reply` (sits alongside existing `/api/zendesk/` routes, uses Zendesk webhook auth)\n- Zendesk trigger: when a ticket tagged `age-review` receives a new reply from the requester, fire webhook\n- Handler matches ticket to case (by case ID in custom field or by requester email lookup)\n- Updates case: log that parent contact was received, optionally transition state to `submitted_for_review`\n- Moderator still makes the final clear/deny decision\n\n### Zendesk-side configuration\n\n- New trigger: \"Age review — parent replied\" (condition: tag `age-review`, requester replied)\n- Webhook target pointing at `POST /api/zendesk/age-review-reply` on the worker\n- Custom field or tag convention for linking ticket to case ID\n- Email template for outbound parent notification\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- PR #67 (age review clock) must be merged first\n- `ZENDESK_API_TOKEN` and `ZENDESK_EMAIL` env vars (already available on the worker for existing Zendesk integration)\n\n## Not in scope\n\n- Auto-closing cases based on Zendesk ticket resolution (moderator decision stays manual)\n- Parent identity verification beyond \"they replied to the email\"\n- Multi-language email templates (English only for MVP)",
